WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.960
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.240
...crazy about you!

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:43.590
Wait, Ryo!

00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:45.580
I'm pregnant!

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:54.030
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:57.600
let's make lots and lots
of happy memories.

00:01:57.600 --> 00:01:58.590
Okay?

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:22.050
"'Forced to Choose"'

00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:24.670
Watch out, Misao-chan!

00:02:24.670 --> 00:02:28.010
Let go of me! What are you doing?!
If this bitch were dead...

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:31.350
--Stop it, Sae-chan!
--Lemme go! Stay outta this!

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:37.290
If only... If only you were dead,
Ryo would come back to me!

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:41.020
Calm down, Kashiwagi-san.

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:46.050
You're carrying a child in your womb.
Getting so excited could harm it.

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:05.740
Ryo-kun gave you this?

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:09.320
I'm going to have it!

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:12.660
I'm absolutely going to have Ryo's baby!

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:14.320
Aki!

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:16.690
What's wrong? You usually
don't come to my office.

00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:22.330
Well! Today you're wearing glasses.
That's different.

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:26.340
What is this? I told you
to talk things over with her!

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:30.340
I did! I told Sae-chan that I had
no intention of seeing her again,

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:31.670
nor of being a father.

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:35.680
But the baby... Kashiwagi-san swears
she's going to have it!

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:40.350
But she can't, not really.
It won't have a father.

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:42.690
I was thinking of Sae-chan's future,

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:44.980
and so I recommended
that she do what was best.

00:03:46.020 --> 00:03:47.690
I think my head's going to split open...

00:03:47.690 --> 00:03:51.690
Maybe your glasses are too strong.
Why not take them off?

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:55.370
To be sure, you're a little
too strong for me, Ryo-kun...

00:03:55.370 --> 00:03:59.870
I didn't realize it... In order to
look my best in front of you, Ryo-kun,

00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:02.970
I always took my glasses off,

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:08.310
but at some point, I must've taken
the glasses of my heart off as well...

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:11.310
I should have looked
more carefully at you, Ryo-kun.

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:12.470
Aki...

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:18.650
Good-bye.

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:22.990
Ryo-kun, I absolutely deplore
the way you treated Kashiwagi-san!

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:39.680
Man, am I hungry!

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:42.010
--Shall we get something
to eat on the way?
--Adachi, aren't you going home?

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.680
Unh-unh, I'm going to wait for Toji.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:47.020
Okay, then. See you!

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:48.210
Bye-bye!

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:59.700
lt's because l've still got this that
l'm still thinking about Okayasu.

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:02.320
l'm going to return it right now!

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:12.310
Huh? What are you doing?

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:13.980
That's my desk.

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:15.570
N- nothing.

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:24.650
Hello?

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:25.660
Hello, Sae-chan?

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:26.660
Ryo!

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:28.650
Last night, Aki dumped me.

00:05:29.990 --> 00:05:35.330
Aki and I don't seem to be suited for
each other. She's a little too stiff for me.

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:39.340
But you, Sae-chan, were happy
with anything that I did!

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:42.000
Sure enough, I shoulda
stuck with you, Sae-chan.

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:43.010
Ryo...

00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:45.680
But I'm probably being selfish, huh...

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:47.010
Mm-mm!

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:50.350
I'm terribly happy! I want
to try again with you, Ryo!

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:51.680
Really?

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:56.350
Say, wanna get together? Actually,
I'm pretty close to the school right now.

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:59.360
Yes, I'll go! Where are you?

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:02.020
Mm-hmm... Got it! I'll be right there!

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:09.300
This?

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:11.300
You've had it the whole time, Momo-chan?

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:15.640
I- I happened to find it!
I just failed to give it back.

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:18.310
Failed to give it back? Why?

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:22.310
Because you had that photo inside it!

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:24.980
Why on earth would you
be carrying such a photo?!

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:28.990
If you're crazy about Misao-chan,
then carry a picture of her around!

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:31.990
Don't go around making me think
you still care! It's a real pain!

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:34.990
I never intended that...

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:37.330
Then why did you come to my house?

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:41.330
You cry like that, and of course
I'd think you still have feelings for me!

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:44.000
But I went there to get
advice about Misao-chan...

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:49.010
Don't play me for a fool! I want to
forget you as soon as I possibly can!

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:51.030
Quit yanking my emotions around!

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:03.350
Momo-chan...

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:13.890
Stop it! You don't love me!

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:22.860
I do love you...

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:32.840
Toji!

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:37.320
H- hey, let me go!

00:07:37.320 --> 00:07:37.990
No!

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:39.660
Let Adachi go!

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:40.990
No!

00:07:40.990 --> 00:07:43.990
Toji, give Momo-chan back to me!

00:07:43.990 --> 00:07:47.460
I really am worthless without Momo-chan!

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:49.670
This time I promise I'll be
good to her, so please!

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:52.000
Give Momo-chan back to me!

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:55.340
Get real! It's not like
she's a puppy or something!

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:57.470
You think I'm going
to give her up so easily?

00:07:57.470 --> 00:08:00.010
Besides, you're crazy
about Misao-sensei, right?

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:03.610
No! The only one I love is Momo-chan!

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:05.620
You're just being selfish now!

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:08.280
Fine! Selfish or not, I'll do anything,

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:11.190
I'll say anything so long as
I can get Momo-chan back!

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:16.290
Misao-chan was the first woman
to be good to me,

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:18.630
and that's why she was so important to me.

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:22.630
That hasn't changed... But...

00:08:22.630 --> 00:08:25.120
But now I am crazy in love with Momo-chan!

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:32.310
Let Adachi go.

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:32.980
No!

00:08:32.980 --> 00:08:35.880
Adachi is dating me now!

00:08:39.320 --> 00:08:41.370
I'm going to make Adachi happy!

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:56.000
Ryo!

00:08:59.340 --> 00:09:00.940
Same as always...

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:01.940
Is that the guy?

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:04.240
Yeah. And don't hold back.

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:12.180
Do you want to go back to Okayasu?

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:16.620
I...

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:19.620
But now I am in love with Momo-chan!

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:21.350
Shall we go back to the classroom?

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:24.990
Let's go back.

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:29.630
Say, Ryo...

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:32.360
Is it okay if I have this baby?

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:39.310
I don't want to leave
my genes in this world.

00:09:39.310 --> 00:09:40.640
Why not?

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:44.980
Why not? You should know
better than anyone, Sae-chan!

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:47.980
What if a sleazebag like me
were to become a father?

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:51.320
It gives me the willies just thinking
what kind of kid I'd raise.

00:09:52.990 --> 00:09:55.320
So you don't want children at all?

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:56.660
No, not at all.

00:09:56.660 --> 00:10:00.660
But aren't your parents going to be lonely?
They would love to see their grandchild...

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:04.670
Kairi can have enough kids for both of us.

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:08.000
That kid Kairi would raise a baby right.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.340
You think so?

00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:14.040
Oh, yeah. Since he was little,
Kairi was good at charming people,

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:16.010
and everybody loved him.

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:18.650
Even though lots of people noticed me,
compared to Kairi,

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:21.350
I never had friends for very long.

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:24.690
And when I did have friends, they'd end up
saying I was not what they thought I was,

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:26.880
or that they didn't know I was gloomy.

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.690
I'm sure my parents preferred Kairi.

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:36.030
Why was Kairi so able to work
his way into people's hearts?

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:40.700
I envied him. I envied him
so much, it made me sick...

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:45.710
I love him, but there've been
times I wished he was dead...

00:10:45.710 --> 00:10:49.380
So, you see, I'm a defective human being.

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:53.050
I'm... I'm the same way.

00:10:53.050 --> 00:10:55.720
I've envied Momo-chan from the very first.

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:58.720
Even though she was all alone,
she was strong, and had a positive attitude.

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:02.660
Anyone who came in contact
with Momo-chan ended up liking her.

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:05.160
No matter how badly I tried
to ruin her reputation,

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:07.000
someone always figured it out.

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:13.000
As I lost the friends around me,
Momo-chan was loved by everybody.

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:16.340
It made me so angry, that I always
acted hostile towards her.

00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:22.010
Why can't I be loved like Momo-chan?
I was so envious...

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:24.310
And you were the same way, Ryo.

00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:28.740
Maybe that's why I was attracted to you...

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:35.360
I'll make a family for you, Ryo.

00:11:35.360 --> 00:11:39.730
A family to keep you from being lonely,
and to love you for your whole life...

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:50.370
Well, well! What a sweet
little thing she is!

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:52.710
Aww, now don't look at us like that!

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:54.380
Let's go.

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:55.710
Wait a minute!

00:11:55.710 --> 00:11:57.380
Oh, don't take her away!

00:11:57.380 --> 00:11:59.720
Yeah, stay with us a while.

00:11:59.720 --> 00:12:01.320
Run!

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:03.150
Don't act the big shot!

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:05.350
Ryo!

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:07.990
Run!

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:08.990
But...

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:10.050
Just go! Hurry!

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:17.330
We'll have Adachi choose
which one of us she wants.

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:21.000
No matter who is chosen,
the other will accept it. Deal?

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:25.630
Choose? Right here? Between these two?

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:30.350
Adachi?

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:31.900
What will you do?

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:35.450
I...

00:12:37.350 --> 00:12:39.020
It's from Sae...

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:40.360
What should I do?

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:42.360
Why not answer it?

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:43.360
Hello?

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:45.030
Help me, Momo-chan!

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:47.030
Sae?! What's happened?

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:49.370
Ryo's... Ryo's being assaulted!

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:51.030
Eh?! What for?

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:55.700
Some guys came to pick a quarrel
with him! Please, Momo-chan, help me!

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:56.690
Sae?!

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:22.330
Stupid man...

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:24.670
This is what he gets for continually
stabbing people in the back.

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:26.670
It's time he learned what pain is.

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:29.330
Stop them! Get those men to stop it!

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:33.010
He's deceiving you, you know.

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:36.010
We heard you. What a pig...

00:13:36.010 --> 00:13:39.010
He'll say whatever it takes,
and then bring you crashing down...

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:41.350
That's not true!

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:43.020
Morika!

00:13:43.020 --> 00:13:47.080
He's the lowest... He's a piece of shit.

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:49.010
No!

00:13:56.370 --> 00:13:58.030
Stop it!

00:13:58.030 --> 00:13:59.860
Stop it already!

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:09.040
Sae!

00:14:09.980 --> 00:14:11.980
Uh-oh... This is bad!

00:14:11.980 --> 00:14:13.980
This chick just suddenly...

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:16.320
I- I'm outta here!

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:18.320
Sae?!

00:14:18.320 --> 00:14:20.320
Sae!

00:14:20.320 --> 00:14:21.290
Sae!!

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:25.020
Idiot.

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:29.950
Sae! Wake up! Sae!

00:14:37.010 --> 00:14:39.010
--Yeah?
--Sae?!

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:40.680
Oh, good! I got through!

00:14:40.680 --> 00:14:42.640
If you're looking for
the owner of this phone,

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:45.350
she's being taken off in an ambulance.

00:14:45.350 --> 00:14:48.020
She got in a fight with some guys,
and got kicked in the stomach.

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:52.020
I- in the stomach? Is Sae all right?!

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:55.020
Who knows? She was
on the ground and not moving.

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:56.960
What hospital were they taking Sae to?

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:03.970
Help it... My baby... Save my baby...

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:06.300
Do you know what month
her pregnancy is in?

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:07.300
No.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:09.300
You're bleeding, too. Face this way.

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:12.980
No, I'm okay. Just look after her.

00:15:12.980 --> 00:15:15.640
I'll make a family for you, Ryo.

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:20.080
A family to keep you from being lonely,
and to love you for your whole life...

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:40.990
Ryo!

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:49.010
A- are you all right?

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:49.750
Where's Sae?

00:15:49.750 --> 00:15:52.140
"'Emergency Room"'

00:15:53.020 --> 00:15:54.680
How did this happen...

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:56.020
It was...

00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:57.380
It was my fault...

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:02.960
Is there a member of her family here?

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:03.960
Family?

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:05.520
Nobody's called them yet.

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:09.970
I'm her baby's father.

00:16:09.970 --> 00:16:11.970
Then, come with me, please.

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:13.030
All right.

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:18.310
We've gotta call
Sae-chan's family right away.

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:20.980
I don't know the number.

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:21.980
Get the phone book.

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:25.980
Ka... Ka... Kashi...
Kashihara... Kashiwa...

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:27.320
Ah! Here it is.

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:29.650
Show me.

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:32.620
Hello? Is this the Kashiwagis?
I'm a classmate of Sae's.

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:34.660
--My name is Tojigamori...
--l couldn't answer...

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:38.330
We'll have Adachi choose
which one of us she wants.

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:42.660
l wasn't able to just
immediately answer ''Toji.'' Why?

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:47.340
There's not a single thing about Toji
that l don't like. Why am l hesitating?

00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:50.400
l don't know... l don't know how l feel...

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:54.700
"'Kashiwagi Sae-dono''

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:59.010
Oh, good! Sae-chan's face is still pretty.

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:01.950
I thought she was a beat-up mess, like Ryo.

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:03.940
Nobody's told us yet...

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:07.510
About the baby.
What happened to the baby?

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:10.960
Is that true?

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:13.960
Yes, we confirmed it with ultrasound.

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:15.550
So, the baby...

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:18.800
I'm sorry to have to say...

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:23.260
Are you awake?

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:27.310
Where's Ryo?

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:29.980
He's talking to the doctor.

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:32.240
H- he'll be right in! Right away!

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:40.990
What's wrong? Do you
hurt someplace? Sae?

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:44.660
The baby... it's gone...

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:49.330
The doctor said they couldn't
find it with the ultrasound...

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:52.990
Ryo's baby is dead...

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:13.390
I'm sorry... I'm sorry I
wasn't able to give you a baby...

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:18.630
There wasn't one.

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:21.300
There never has been a baby.

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:24.300
It was an imaginary pregnancy.

00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:26.300
No! That's a lie!

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:30.640
I used a pregnancy test kit, and it came
out positive! I had morning sickness!

00:18:30.640 --> 00:18:32.770
But you didn't have it checked
at a hospital, did you?

00:18:33.980 --> 00:18:38.310
An imaginary pregnancy will register
positive in a home pregnancy test kit.

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:41.650
The human mind is an incredible thing.

00:18:41.650 --> 00:18:43.190
Even when not pregnant,

00:18:43.190 --> 00:18:46.320
some women produce the same
hormones that pregnancy does.

00:18:46.320 --> 00:18:50.990
They get morning sickness,
and some even have their bellies swell.

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:54.450
She must have really badly
wanted to be pregnant...

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:14.040
How stupid... An imaginary pregnancy...
What a laugh...

00:19:14.950 --> 00:19:21.620
I told Ryo I was going to make a family
for him... but there never was a baby...

00:19:21.620 --> 00:19:23.350
How stupid...

00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:26.190
Sae...

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:39.640
Is it okay to leave her alone?

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:45.310
She says she wants to be alone,
so let's do as she wishes.

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:49.880
Well, then, what shall we do?
Shall we settle that matter from earlier?

00:19:55.320 --> 00:19:56.990
Right here?

00:19:56.990 --> 00:19:59.390
Okay. Let's go somewhere else.

00:19:59.390 --> 00:20:01.660
"'Reception Information"'

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:09.340
Ryo-kun!

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:10.500
Aki!

00:20:12.010 --> 00:20:17.450
What dreadful injuries! Who did
this to you? And Kashiwagi-san?!

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:19.350
Is she all right?

00:20:19.350 --> 00:20:21.020
She was kicked in
the stomach, wasn't she?

00:20:21.020 --> 00:20:23.490
She wasn't in a stable period
of her pregnancy yet.

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:25.180
There's a huge chance of a miscarriage...

00:20:29.020 --> 00:20:30.220
Ryo-kun?

00:20:31.690 --> 00:20:33.030
Huh?

00:20:33.030 --> 00:20:35.700
What's Misao-sensei doing here?

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:37.370
I called her.

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:38.730
That was nice of you.

00:20:40.370 --> 00:20:44.500
l get it! lt was Misao-chan who he
was texting a message to earlier...

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:50.410
Okayasu...

00:20:53.050 --> 00:20:53.720
Okayasu?!

00:20:53.720 --> 00:20:55.210
Sorry! Give me a minute!

00:20:58.990 --> 00:21:01.050
"'Restroom"'

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:13.340
I can't believe it... I'm so terrified...

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:15.060
How pitiful!

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.010
Adachi...

00:21:18.010 --> 00:21:20.440
If you don't choose me, it's all right.

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:24.750
It's impossible to stop one's heart
when it goes in a direction.

00:21:24.750 --> 00:21:27.680
It only changes over time.

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:31.020
Adachi, if your heart
doesn't lean in my direction,

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:33.690
there's no need to punish yourself for it.

00:21:33.690 --> 00:21:36.020
Adachi, if you choose Okayasu,

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:41.360
it'll be because he can give you something
that I can't. That's what I think.

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:44.360
You just think about how you truly feel.

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:49.700
How I truly feel...

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:52.300
Sorry! Didn't mean to keep you...

00:22:15.330 --> 00:22:16.890
I'm sorry, Okayasu...

00:22:19.000 --> 00:22:21.160
I really think it
wouldn't work between us...

00:22:36.760 --> 00:22:43.100
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:43.100 --> 00:22:52.780
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.780 --> 00:22:55.780
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.780 --> 00:23:02.390
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.390 --> 00:23:08.720
Where can we go

00:23:08.720 --> 00:23:18.400
where we can all be

00:23:18.400 --> 00:23:21.070
under the same sky?

00:23:21.070 --> 00:23:29.410
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.410 --> 00:23:36.090
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:36.090 --> 00:23:42.430
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.430 --> 00:23:49.770
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.770 --> 00:23:57.230
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:03.050
No! That can't be true!

00:24:03.050 --> 00:24:07.380
Okayasu was just like he always was,
even after coming back from Shiranami!

00:24:07.380 --> 00:24:11.390
l'm meeting Toji soon, but l can't,
not feeling like this!

00:24:11.390 --> 00:24:14.550
Next time on Peach Girl,
"'The Truth About Good-byes"'
